# Temporarily ignored since a KEEP wildcard with a backquoted leg drops the column instead of matching it. See https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/158466
# The rows below are the expected results once fixed - identical to what the equivalent KEEP id, tags* produces above.
backquotedPrefixWildcardKeepLosesUnmappedField-Ignore
